{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965430/extras/215829a3ff5c2f64b129cbcb84b642a8.avif?t=1773247274\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just started working in the mailroom of that weird building on 5th. The job was easy enough at first. Sort the mail and use their creaky old pneumatic tube system to send it to the correct departments. But then shit started getting weird. Can you figure out what's really going on in this place and find a way out?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mailroom is a short horror game about working a dead-end job in a basement mailroom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use clues to correctly identify and sort mail</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965430/extras/ffbb05fc1920ca944bf7c78e8dbae804.poster.avif?t=1773247274\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965430/extras/ffbb05fc1920ca944bf7c78e8dbae804.webm?t=1773247274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965430/extras/ffbb05fc1920ca944bf7c78e8dbae804.mp4?t=1773247274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dissect and process raw ingredients into materials needed by the upper floors</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965430/extras/1842cebd8c7894a25d42dae622dc40cd.poster.avif?t=1773247274\" width=780 h